  "description": "“Shhh… They won’t find out…” During a class where I was working as a nude model, I ran into the last person I expected. In a place like this… Looking like this… I never imagined we would meet again this way. An art professor, ten years older than me, and my sister’s best friend. And, on top of that… the person I have been secretly in love with. “What a beautiful body… If only I could draw a body like this…” “Let me do it… Please let me be your model, Hitoka.” A private lesson with just the two of them. As somewhat twisted feelings begin to entangle them both, crossing the line becomes all too easy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10876770)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10876721)\n\n**Official Translations:**       \nR19: [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/secret-touch/list?title_no=7264), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000397), [Spanish](https://www.lezhin.es/detail/el-arte-de-la-manipulacion), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/secret-touch/list?title_no=7545)     \nR15: [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000396)",
